<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">Solomon Hla</book>
  <para style="h">Solomon Hla</para>
  <para style="toc1">Solomon Hla</para>
  <para style="toc2">Solomon Hla</para>
  <para style="mt">Solomon Hla</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hla lakih hla ṭha bik, Solomon ih mi hlamawi pawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na hmur in i hnam aw, I ngainak cu sabitti hnakin a thlum sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang cu a hmui in na hmui, Zihmui bangin na hmin a thang. Nunau zokhal nang ngai loin um thei hlah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I hruai awla kan tlanhlo ding; Ka bawipa si awla na umnak khaan ah i fehpi aw. Hmunkhatah nuam tlang uhsi; Diriam in kan duh awknak thuk sungah kan ciah aw ding. Nunau hmuahhmuah in an lo ngai hi an mawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem leengrual tla, Dum hman ningna mi mawi ka si; Kedar deuthlam bang ka dum naón, Solomon inn puanzar iang in ka mawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka dum ruangah i iai hlah uh, Ni ih i eet ruangah hin; Ka ṭa le pawl ka parah an thinheng in, Sabit dum ah hna in ṭuanter; Zutmetawknak caan hman nei loin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I sim hnik law, nang ka ngai aw; Khuiah simaw na tuurual na khalh? Khuiah simaw an colh ding sun ni ling ah? Ziangah so tuukhal dang pawl ih tuurual lakah, Ka lo hawl rero ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nunau lakih duh thla leeng bik, Nang in a hmun na thei lo maw? Feh awla tuurual pawl thlun aw; Tuukhal pawl ih thlamte kiangah Na me hrangah tlimno hawl aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngai bikmi nang cun, Rang nu pakhat in Faro rangleng hnuktu rangcang tampi lung a thawhter bangin, Valrual thinlung na thawhter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mawi tuk aw khua na sawm ai sam na biang tlunah, Man sung lung bang na hngawng tlunah tlai sialso te in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmanseh na hrang ṭaang orh sui ṭhi tuah uhsi, Ngun khuut hlawn thil thawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tintling tlunah, zau maw ka bawi, Ka zihmui rimthaw in a zeel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka lungduh cu mura rimthaw bang hmui, Ka siang ṭaang cung par a zau ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka lungduh valpa cu ram pangpar iang, An sim Engedi sabit hmuan parmawi khi bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mawi sersi ee, ka duh bik cu, Duhnunnak na mit ah ni bang tle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lungduh cem, valno lakah na piang hlei ce! Nuam cuang hlei in lung i ngamter, Zaunak tintling, hramhring hmang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan inn kaan ah sidar thing, A siling ah farthing si ngai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei cu Sharon ramlak in pangpar le Tlangrawn ṭe lili par vek ka si men.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hlingbur lak ih lili par bang, Lung ka duh nu a leenghawi lakah si ve ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lung ka duh valpa cu a val hawi lakah, Tuthing lak um epal kung bang a cuang; A phenthlam hnuai ah to ningna, A rah ka hrangah a thlum hlei ce.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A puai khaanpi sung i hruai lut, Duhnak puanzar ka tlun a zaar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sabit caar in ka tha tlungter, Epal rah in ka zaang damter; Zuun ngaih vangah, ka uai hninghniang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kehlam kut in i ṭaangkham ih, A vorhlam kut in kei i pom.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem leengrual le tla, Kan duhawknak kharhmar lo dingin, Zuanzaang tlancak zukneng zaatum, hminsaal in kei thu in kam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka duh valpa ih aanka thei ing, Ra tlan vervo thlua tlang cungin, Tlangsang kaan in ka hnenah zuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tum val zaatum no bang, No thianthite zukneng a iang; Cunah dir maw pharson kiangah, Tukvirh ongin i rak cuan maw, Ral vanphar tal in tin a bih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aanka i hlan lung ka duh cun, Duh hniang, ra aw, Lung ka duh cem rata hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlatang khawdai a cem zo ih, Vanrial ruahpi a kang ve zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hramlak ah pangpar an par zo. Hlasak caan cu tu hi a si; Thuro hlasak ram sung a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theipi rah tla cu an hmin thlang, Zilthli lakah hmui verver in, Sabit par rimhmui a zeel aw. Duh hniang, ra aw, Lung ka duh cem rata hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungpi kua sungih a relhmi Kaiva thuro bangtuk na si. Iang nei na mithmai zoh ka duh Na aw thlumte tla theih ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cinghnia pawl kha kaita hai uh, A cuih cinghnia fano tla kha; Sabit hmuan parmawite an siatsuah ta hlanah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I duhtu ih ta cu ka si, Anih khal ka ta a si ve. A tuurual cu lili par lakah a kil,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zinglam thlizil nem a hrang ih Zinglam khawfing a cah tiangin, Ra kir thlang aw, ka duh bikmi, Bether tlang ih zukneng le zaathar tla bangin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zansiar ka tintling ah zau ing, Ka duh nang hi zanmang lawng ah maw ka lo man; Hawl len hmanning ka tong thiam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawpi kot-thler zalam tawi in, Zinpi, zinṭeek khalah ka zoh; Lung ka duh val lawng cu ka hawl, Hmanseh ka tong thei ve si lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawsuah hau-hnar kiltuón in hmu, “Ka duh valpa nan hmu maw?” tiin ka sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anmah ka lan vete in ka tong; Thlah thiam nawn loin kutin ka kai; Ka suahsemnak ka nuih innsung thlenpi hlan cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem leengrual le tla, Kan duhawknak kharhmar lo dingin, Zuanzaang tlan cak zukneng, zaathar hminsaal in, kei thu in kam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nelrawn ihsin meikhu zing bang, Sumsaw hawltu pawl ih zuarmi, Zihmui le mura rimthaw thawn, A rami hi ziangso a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon a ra luailo lai, A bawi tokheng parah an phur; Israel ralkap sungih ṭha bik, Ralkap sawmruk tla in an kil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An zatein ralnam hmang thiam, Raldo ṭhangtu thiam pawl si hai. Ralnam cio kha an hmanter ih, Zan ih ral ruk do thei dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thing ṭha bikih tuahmi a bawi tokheng parah, Solomon siangpahrang bawi an phur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawi tokheng ke ngun in an khuut, Sui pianzia puan in an tuam, Coihcinmawi suipuan mawi cun; A todan nem sendup puanih tuammi, Duhnungza in Jerusalem nuih tahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ra suak cio uh Zion nunau, Siangpahrang Solomon ra zoh uh; A sui lukhuh a lu tlunah a khum, A nupi ṭhit a lungawi le thinnom ni ih A nu ih khumter mi cu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mawi sersi ee, ka duh bik cu, Na lu tuamnak puanmawi phen ih Duhnak khat mi na mit sersi, Gilead tlang in merual tlan bang Na samthlai rem zam sialso hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meh le kholhfai mi tuuhmul bang Na ha tianrem vaarte in an fai; A beuh um lo rem thliahthli hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Patsen hlaar bang na hmur a mawi, Na ṭong mawite khawh a theih lo; Na lukhuhnak puan naal phen in, Na biang note a lang cemci.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hngawng, David lungdawl sang bang, Ngil ih a hluum zetmi a bang; Ralphaw thawngkhat baannak bangtuk, Hlawnthil ṭhirual erhnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na siangṭaang ih pawhte tla cu, Lili pangpar mawi bik lakih, Zukneng faphir pawhfawp an bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mura zihmui tlang cung parah, Cuih rimhmui tlang ah ka um ding; Zinglam thlizil a hran tik le, Khawfing a cah tiang ka um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka duh bikmi na mawizia hi! Soi ding um loin na mawi hleice!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lebanon tlang in i thlun aw, ka ham cia mi; Lebanon ihsin rung hram aw; Kiosa le tlavang pawl an umnak Amana Tlang, Senir tlang le Hermon tlang ihsin rung ṭum aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zohkhop thei lo ka thainu ding, Na ṭaang cung ṭhi erh mi tla in, Ka lung thinril hmuah in a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I duhnak in ka lung ngamter, Ka lunghnemtu le ka ham cia; I hnamnak cu sabit hnakin a thlum sawn; Na zihmui cu ziangdang hnakin a rim a hmui sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka duh bikmi, Na hmur khuaitizu bang in a thlum; Na ṭong ka hrang hnawi le khuaitizu bang an si. Na thilthuam cu Lebanon rimhmui bang a hmui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thinhnemtu, ka ham ciami, A thup lakih hmuan vek a si; Kulh mi hmuan le maih bul cerhti;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A cu tawkah hanghnah ziangkim mawite in an cerh; Hmangthaw rahnak taleti hmuan bangin an ciing; Hmangṭha bik in a rah a suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Henna le nard, saffron le, Kalamus le sinamon pawl, Rimhmui phunphun an kim a si. Mura le aloi tla an um, Rimhmui bik phun tiangin an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cerhti put le tiva luang in Cuih hmuan cu an hningter ringring; Lebanon tlang ihsin rung luang, Tiva pawl in ciarter ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw saklam thli, nang ṭhang thlang aw; Maw thlanglam thli, ka hmuan hran aw; A sungah rimhmui khatter aw; Lung ka duh val a hmuan pan seh, A hmang thlum bikmi rah ei seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hmuanduum sungah ka ra zo, Ka lung duh le ka ham cia mi! Ka mura le rimhmui ka khawm; Ka khuaitizu thlar thawn ka ei, Ka sabitti le cawhnawi ka in. Ei uh, in uh, duhdawtmi tla, Duh-awknak nan rit hlan tiangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka vung zau ah me rem thiam lo, Zan ka mangah ka duhdawt mi in ruuninn king ngai. Ra lut ning law, ka duh bikmi, Ka thuro le ka thinhnemtu, Ka lu daitla in a ciarter, Ka sam cu mero cumci in a hnawng ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hnipuan pawl ka hlit ṭheh zo, Ziangah ka hruk sal duh nawn ding? Ka ke tla ka kholhfai ṭheh zo, Ziangah ka baalter sal duh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lung ka duh cun sangka run tham, A rat thei ing, um rem thiam hlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A luh ding lai caang in cuan ing, Ka kut zaṭial mura zihmui culhta ing khaw, Ka kut zung mura zihmui ti ka riimter, Ruuninn on lainak ah sangka cu rak pawk ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lungduh hrang innkhar ka ong, Hmanseh valpa a liamhlo zo; Ziangbang a aw theih nuam ing maw? Khua ka cuanah a um nawn lo. Ko hman ningna a thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpi kilvengtu in kei in hmu, An duh tawk in in vuak in hliam, Ralhruang kiltu pawl in ka lukhuh an thlek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem leengnu rual tla, Lung ka duh val nan ton ahcun, Zuun rim ngai in par bang uai ee, ti in biathli hei than hram uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lengdang lakah mawi cuang hlei nu, Lung na tum val, midang lakah cuangce hmen maw? Ziang bang sunglawi mi piang a si? Thutiam kan lo peknak dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mawi in cak ee, ka valpa cu, Thawnghra lakah a piang hleice.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hmai daarti lon bang a ngil, A sam kir deuh nawnten a um. Tlang ak vek in a dum zenzi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tiva kiangih thuro bangin a mit a mawi, Tivakap ding hnawiti kholhfai thuro bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A biang cu pangpar le rimhmui in a khat mi, Hmuanduum bang duhnungte a si. A hmur lili pangpar a bang, Mura zihmui ti in a ciar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kut an mawi soi ding um lo, Lung mankhung bik zunghruk a hruk; Lungsen mankhung ben mi saiho, bangin a taksa ngil zenzi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sui kheng sungih lungvar mankhung, Ret mi bangin a cawn a vaar. Ka valpa cu patling hleice, Sidar thingsaang dinnak Lebanon tlang khi hei hluan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hmur thlum cu hnam ding a nuam, A thu tinkim ka ruat tikah ka zaang i zuun. Ka ngai mi cu cuvek a si, Jerusalem khua nunau pawl.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nunau lakih mimawi hleice, Na ngai mi cu khui ah a feh? Kan lo hawlpi theinak dingah, A fehnak lam in sim hnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lung ka duh val a hmuan ah kal, Balsam zihmui thing tla a ciinnak ah. Lili pangpar tla khawm phah in, A hmuan sungah tuurual a kil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lung ka duh bik, ka ta a si, Kei khal a ta ka si, Lili pangpar lakah a tuurual tla a khal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungtak ka duh, Jerusalem khua bang na mawi, An sim Tirzah khawpi bangin duh na nung ce; Hi khua pawl bang na mawinak in, Lungmolh thawthawt lo tiang i tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mit a dang zoh thlang hram aw, Caang thiam lo in i kaih taang tak. Gilead tlang in merual tlan bang, Na sam thlairem zam sialso hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Meh le kholhfai mi tuuhmul bangin, Na ha tianrem vaarte in an fai; A beuh um lon rem thliahthli hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na lu khuhnak puan naal phen in, Na biang note a lang cemci.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A duh ahcun siangpahrang in, Nupi sawmruk, nusuun sawmriat va nei ko seh. Lengdawh note siar cawk lo in neita ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmanseh kei cun pakhat lawngte duh in ngai ing, Cu nute cu thuro bang duhnung a si. A nuih fa neih hman ih neihsun, A duh hleimi fanu a si. A zohtu hmuah nunau tla in an fak cio thluh; Siangpahrang nupi, nungai, nusun, hman in amah faknak hla an sak cio a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zing khawtleu bang mit-men mawite zo a si ta? A mawi sersi, a pan veuvi; Ni le thla iang in a tle mawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭhuangkung lakah ka ra thleng zo, Phaivun rawn ih zanthing note, Sabit parih hnah no cerh le, Taleti par ra zoh dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Raldo dingih rangleng mawngtu, Daite ih a um thei lo bangin, Ngai awknak in i thirter thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lam aw, lam aw, Shulam leengdawh; Na lam lai cu kan lo zoh ding. I zohtu pawl tlar le tlar lakih ka lam hi, Ziangruangah maw a zoh nan duh?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A cungsin ce leengnu na si, Vai tuah kedam hruk nang na mawi; Na cawn mawi ee, vaimi thiam thil zung suakte bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rimhmui catlo a umnak sabit kheng, Cuih khengte bang na lai mawi ee; Lili pangpar mawite ih kulh mi, Sangvut teel hluum bang in na pum mawi ee.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na siangṭaang ih pawhte tla cu, Zukneng faphirte vek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saiho innsang a bang na hngawng, Heshbon khawpi kotka kiangih, Tili bangtuk na mit a si; Damaskas khawpi ral an vennak, Lebanon ram ralven innsang, Bang mi duhnung hnar mawi na nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Karmel tlang bang na lu sangah a khai deudi, Na sam phiar mi pat femte naal bangin a tle; A mawinak in siangpahrang lungthin a kai thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na cuan a mawi, na hmel a ṭha, Zalung hneem thiamtu na duhnak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zoh mawi tuumkung bang iang na nei, Na siangṭaang ah tumrah bor bang pawhte a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuumkung parah kai in a rah cu lo hnik lang, Ka hrangah cun na pawhte cu, sabit rah bawrte vek a si. Na thawthawt epal rimthaw bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kaa rim cu sabitti thlum bik khi a bang, sabitti luang detdo seh, lung ka duh hnen ah, A hmur a ha tiangin lon seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei cu in ngaitu ih ta ka si, A hiar mi cu kei ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Duhte ra aw, ramdai thiangah va leeng tlang in, Lai lungrawn khua ah caam uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zingthlapit in tho in sabit kung zoh uhsi; Cerh thlang in par thlang hai maw ti khi va zoh in, Taleti par thlang hai maw tin, A cuih hmuan ah lungsung duh bia thu lo ruah lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leeng-ai rah par rimhmui na hnim thei ding, Kan sangka kiangah thing rah tinkim an um ding; Lung ka duh aw, nomnak hlun le nomnak thar tla, Na hrang siseh ti in ka ret.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sunghno ka nuih hnawiti cawm mi rak si ve in, Ka suahseempi ka ṭa sita la maw ka ti; An sial zatlanglam ih ka lo ton caang zongah, Hnam ning ka ti an phai relsiat hman phang lo leen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lawipi ning law sunghno ka nuih ruuninn hnuai ah, Lungsak te leen dawtnak i sim thiam ding ka ti; Sabitti le taleti sawrmi rimthaw cu, Siah ta hnik ning na hrang haalriam na in dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na keh lam in i ṭaangkham ih, Na vorhlam kut in kei i pom.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem leengrual le tla, Kan duh awknak kharhmar lo ding thu in kam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Husihmen maw thlaler ramṭhing lakin a ra, Lung a duh valpa thawn zaṭial tlai aw phah leen. Na suahsemnak lungrawn khawte, Epal thinghnuai ah lo ṭhang ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimah siarlo leeng dang ngai hlah, Keimah siar lo na ṭaang cungah pom duh aw hlah; Zuunrim ngaih cu thih ṭian bang leen a fak ruangmang, Lungfah hi ee thih ṭian bang leen zaang mi zuun ngai; Meisa alh bang a hliau in hliau, Meisa kaang bang a alh in alh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mit thei hlah ee dairial ti in, Ruun tilian in fen thei hlah ngai; Zokhal a lennak in duhnak lei tumtu cu, Nautatnak lawng a co sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tleirawl leengno farnu kan nei, A pawhte cu a bomh pekte; Valno in a leen tikah khin, A hrangah ziang kan tuah sak ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Seempi farnu kulh hauhruang phar va si sehla, Kan siamsak lai ngun lung dawl saang, Ruuninn kotṭial va si sehla, Sidar thing in kan kulh ih tur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawkulh hauhruang phar cu ka si, Ka pawhte lungdawl saang an si. Amah thawn um ka nomzia le ka hnangam hi, Duhhniang a man, a thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Baal Hamon an timi hmun ah, Ka Solomon in sabit hmuan a nei; Lo nga pek in a lo an thlo, Mi pakhat in a nga sum thawngkhat an pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Solomon, ngun thawngkhat cu na ta a si, Lo thlo pawl ih covo cu zahnih a si. Keimah bul in sabit hmuan ka nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka dawt sunghno na aanka cu, Ka hmuan sungin i rak hlaan aw, ka lungduh; Hawidawt ṭhianrual mi tlan na aw an ngai duh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram sazuk bang ka hnen ra law, Maw ka dawt aw; Tlangthing kuai par hmui lak a ceel zukneng no bang.
  </para>
</usx>
